    "first_action": "Call the describe_sqlite tool with the database path the step names, with names_only true first when the full description is too large, and note the exact table and column names before writing any SELECT.",
    "done_when": [
      "The rows that answer the step are held together with the exact SQL and parameters that produced them.",
      "more_rows is false for the final query, or the step accepts the first max_rows rows."
    ],
    "stop_and_report_when": [
      "query_sqlite refuses a statement as a write, a PRAGMA or ATTACH, or stops it at the time or memory limit.",
      "The database is not an SQLite file, is outside the workspace root, or is in WAL mode with pending changes.",
      "Neither tool is listed, whatever prefix the harness adds to the names; run the package tests. If they pass, the harness did not start a working server: report that. Otherwise report their last line."
    ],
